	I know, that you are here for fun and etc… But I am need your help and millions like me also.
	Please support my very friend Dima, he is a volunteer, who work with medical equipment for soldiers and different request for civilians in liberated terittories. His paypal email is <u>dmytro.skihin@gmail.com</u>
	If you have no trust to me (I can understand this, I am just some text on your monitor), please support Ukraine in any other way you can (this government site as example: <u>https://u24.gov.ua/</u>)
	We are needed to win (cuz it''s the only way to survive), and we really need your support.</b>'
	*nl
	'<b>THANK YOU!!!</b>'
	'<b>Dima constantly support our front soldiers with a military med kits. And I know, you helped him with this.</b>'
	'<b>Thank you! I am proud about our community!</b>'

	act 'continue':
